      "body": "Lando 地址：https://lando.lianggejia.cn/\n\nLando 是一款 **AI LandingPage 生成器**。\nLando is an AI landing page generator. \n\n你用一段话描述项目，**AI 自动生成官网**并**收集用户意向**。\nDescribe your project in plain text, and the AI creates a beautiful landing page in minutes—with lead collection built in. \n\n不会写代码也能在 5 分钟上线。\nNo coding required. \n\n适合**创业验证**、**个人项目展示**和**小微企业建站**。\nPerfect for validating ideas, personal projects, and small business websites.\n\n",
